
.subckt astra_017_cmos_time_to_voltage vdd VSS integrate sample iref reset out
CH out VSS 2p
CI net1 VSS 10p
M1 iref iref vdd vdd APMOS l=2u w=10u
M10 net1 sample out VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M2 net2 iref vdd vdd APMOS l=2u w=10u
M3 net1 net0 net2 vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 net1 reset VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 net0 integrate vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M6 net0 integrate VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M7 net3 sample vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=10u
M8 net3 sample VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=4u
M9 net1 net3 out vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
RL out VSS 1g
.ends astra_017_cmos_time_to_voltage
